-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ו/1 (18.6.2025): העסקת עו"ה, עובדי בעלות, בבתי ספר לחינוך מיוחד מוכרים שאינם רשמיים, בהתאם לרפורמת אופק חדש בשנה"ל תשפ"ו
-- Bringing the teaching staff of recognised unofficial special-education
-- schools into the Ofek Hadash reform: the owners' undertaking and steps,
-- who joins, the work week, part-time and over-time employment, a mother's
-- position, age hours, principals and deputies, school activities, leaving
-- the reform, seniority, promotion, counsellors, the grade and role
-- allowances, trips, the salary advance, the attendance clock, and the
-- annexes (the undertaking, the forms, and the salary conversion).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in DAYS from the circular's date,
-- 18 June 2025 (day 0); 31 August 2025 is day 74.
`31 August 2025` MEANS 74

-- Agorot: amounts are rounded half up to the agora where the circular's
-- examples print a rounded figure.
GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `to the agora` x IS
    TRUNC (x TIMES 100 PLUS 0.5) 0 DIVIDED BY 100

§ `תשפ"ו/1 העסקת עו"ה בבתי ספר לחינוך מיוחד מוכרים שאינם רשמיים באופק חדש`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (18.6.2025), reference, addressee (owners of recognised unofficial special-education schools not yet in Ofek Hadash) and subject line; no rule.

DECLARE `reform action` IS ONE OF
    `send the signed undertaking`
    `send the undertaking with proof of operating and paying by Ofek Hadash`
    `check that the teachers' data are current`
    `instruct unreported teachers to open an online file`
    `employ the joining teachers on Ofek Hadash terms`
    `set the timetable by the Ofek Hadash work week`
    `place every teacher in the placement system`
    `send the salary interface to the Ministry's contractor`
    `pay by the grade set and deduct the advances`
    `join the schools and mark them in the Ministry's systems`
    `check each teacher's conditions and decide on joining`
    `set the Ofek Hadash grade`
    `compute the school's Ofek Hadash profile`
    `reimburse the owning body`
    `pay the Ofek Hadash advance` HAS `advance paid` IS A NUMBER
    `install an attendance clock`
    `report working hours by the clock`
    `pay and deduct by the clock`
    `apply all the Ofek Hadash provisions`
    `impose sanctions up to revoking the licence`

§§ `1 מבוא`

-- akn:art_1/p1 A recital: the State's undertaking in HCJ 148/18 (WIZO v. Ministry of Education) to equalise teaching resources in recognised unofficial special-education schools with official ones from תש"ף.
-- akn:art_1/p2 A recital: the inter-ministerial team set up by the Director-General, whose conclusions were adopted from תש"ף.
-- akn:art_1/p3 The team's report is published at the link that follows; no rule.
-- akn:art_1/p4 The report's address; no rule.
-- akn:art_1/p5 The report's address, continued; no rule.
-- akn:art_1/p6 A recital: from תש"ף Ofek Hadash's terms were applied to these schools.
-- akn:art_1/p11 The circular's purpose: to explain the instructions for teachers employed by owning bodies in these schools for תשפ"ו.

-- The State Education (Recognised Institutions) Regulations, as amended in
-- 2022, regulation 3(6): in a special-education institution (other than a
-- special-education class), salaries follow the rates and rules of official
-- special-education institutions in the new programme. So every
-- special-education institution not yet in Ofek Hadash joins under the
-- regulations, subject to the signed undertaking and to this circular.
@ref akn:art_1/p7 akn:art_1/p8 akn:art_1/p9
GIVEN `the owner signed the undertaking` IS A BOOLEAN, `the owner meets the circular` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school joins Ofek Hadash` `the owner signed the undertaking` `the owner meets the circular` IF
    `the owner signed the undertaking` AND `the owner meets the circular`

-- The Ministry alone approves a teacher's joining, sets the Ofek Hadash
-- grade and converts the salary; as before, it sets the education grade and
-- the seniority in teaching (again in 15.1).
@ref akn:art_1/p10 akn:art_15__para_15-1
DECLARE `reform decision` IS ONE OF
    `approve a teacher's joining`
    `set the Ofek Hadash grade`
    `convert the salary`
    `set the education grade`
    `set the seniority in teaching`

GIVEN d IS A `reform decision`
GIVETH A Party
DECIDE `who decides` d IS `the Ministry of Education`

§§ `2 תחומי אחריות ביישום הרפורמה`

-- akn:art_2__para_2-1/p1 The heading "שלב ראשון"; its steps follow.
-- akn:art_2__para_2-1/p2 The heading "actions by the owning body"; they follow.

-- 2.1.1: the owner signs the undertaking (annex A) and sends it to the
-- Ministry by 31.8.2025.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_1/p4 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_1/p5
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `the undertaking by 31.8.2025` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `send the signed undertaking`
    WITHIN `31 August 2025`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  `joining after the deadline`

-- After the deadline, an owner who asks to join must add proof of operating
-- the school by the Ofek Hadash plan and of paying salaries on this
-- circular's terms — "provided that these institutions received a late
-- licence, i.e. after 1.9".
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_1/p6
`joining after the deadline` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MAY   `send the undertaking with proof of operating and paying by Ofek Hadash`

GIVEN `licensed after 1.9` IS A BOOLEAN, `the undertaking was sent by 31.8.2025` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may join late under 2.1.1` `licensed after 1.9` `the undertaking was sent by 31.8.2025` IF
    (NOT `the undertaking was sent by 31.8.2025`) AND `licensed after 1.9`

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_01-b: an owner licensed before 1.9 that misses
-- 31.8.2025 is neither on time nor within the late-joining proviso.
GIVEN `licensed after 1.9` IS A BOOLEAN, `the undertaking was sent by 31.8.2025` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `2.1.1 decides the owner's joining` `licensed after 1.9` `the undertaking was sent by 31.8.2025` IF
    `the undertaking was sent by 31.8.2025` OR `may join late under 2.1.1` `licensed after 1.9` `the undertaking was sent by 31.8.2025`

`an owner licensed on time that misses the deadline is undecided` MEANS
    NOT `2.1.1 decides the owner's joining` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `an owner licensed on time that misses the deadline is undecided`

-- 2.1.2: the "teaching staff data" report in the עוש"ר system. א: the owner
-- checks that the teachers' data (education, seniority including army and
-- national service, in-service training and double degree) are current;
-- if not, a contact person is advised ("מוצע") to collect the documents and
-- apply to the district's teaching-staff manager. ב: teachers not yet
-- reported (health-profession and arts therapists included) are told to
-- open an online file urgently, per the circular on employment approval for
-- תשפ"ו. ג: then the teachers meeting the joining conditions (section 3)
-- are identified.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2__cls_a akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2__cls_a/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `the teachers' data checked` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `check that the teachers' data are current`

@ref akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2__cls_b akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2__cls_b/p4
GIVEN `teachers not yet reported` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `unreported teachers told to open a file` `teachers not yet reported` IS
    IF `teachers not yet reported` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `instruct unreported teachers to open an online file`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2__cls_b/p2 The teachers' portal address; no rule.
-- akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2__cls_b/p3 The address, continued; no rule.
-- akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2__cls_c The step that follows: identifying the teachers who meet section 3's conditions, encoded there.

-- 2.1.3: the teachers meeting the conditions are employed on Ofek
-- Hadash's salary terms and work week (the 2022 agreement and earlier
-- updates; section 4).
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `joining teachers employed on Ofek Hadash terms` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `employ the joining teachers on Ofek Hadash terms`

-- The principal's part: guide teachers without a file (health and arts
-- therapists included) through the online file; set the timetable by the
-- Ofek Hadash work week (section 4); and place every teacher the owning body
-- employs in the placement system — those who join on reform terms, those
-- who do not on pre-reform terms.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_3/p2 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_3__cls_1 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_3__cls_2 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_3__cls_3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `the principal's steps` IS
    (PARTY `the school principal`
     MUST  `set the timetable by the Ofek Hadash work week`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the school principal`
     MUST  `place every teacher in the placement system`)

-- akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_3__cls_3/p2 Points to attached reporting instructions for these schools; they are not in the corpus.

-- akn:art_2__para_2-2/p1 The heading "שלב שני"; its steps follow.
-- akn:art_2__para_2-2/p2 The heading of the owner's steps for the initial grade; they follow.

-- 2.2.1–2.2.2: the owner sends the contractor (Unique) the interface of the
-- salary it paid; the Ministry sets the grade and converts; the owner then
-- pays by the grade from the teacher's joining date and deducts the
-- advances. F-2025-26_tashpo_01-c: the advances are "כאמור בסעיף 15
-- להלן", and section 15 is the grade; the advances are section 17.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `the owner's second stage` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `send the salary interface to the Ministry's contractor`
    HENCE (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
           MUST  `set the Ofek Hadash grade`
           HENCE (PARTY `the employer`
                  MUST  `pay by the grade set and deduct the advances`))

DECLARE `section of the circular` IS ONE OF
    `section 1`, `section 2`, `section 3`, `section 4`, `section 5`, `section 6`,
    `section 7`, `section 8`, `section 9`, `section 10`, `section 11`, `section 12`,
    `section 13`, `section 14`, `section 15`, `section 16`, `section 17`, `section 18`

GIVEN s IS A `section of the circular`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the subject of` s IS
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `section 12` THEN "seniority in teaching"
    WHEN `section 13` THEN "promotion in grades"
    WHEN `section 15` THEN "setting the grade in Ofek Hadash"
    WHEN `section 17` THEN "salary advances in Ofek Hadash until the grade is set"
    OTHERWISE "another subject"

`the section 2.2.2 cites for the advances` MEANS `section 15`

`2.2.2 cites section 15 for the advances, which section 17 holds` MEANS
        (NOT (`the subject of` `the section 2.2.2 cites for the advances` EQUALS `the subject of` `section 17`))
    AND `the subject of` `section 17` EQUALS "salary advances in Ofek Hadash until the grade is set"
#ASSERT `2.2.2 cites section 15 for the advances, which section 17 holds`

-- The Ministry's part (¶3-¶11, numbered 1-5): on receiving the undertaking,
-- join the schools and mark them; check each teacher's conditions (after
-- the teacher's תשפ"ו position is reported) and decide; set the grade;
-- compute the school's profile; reimburse the owner. Without the placement
-- system updated to the Ofek Hadash week and the salary interface sent, the
-- Ministry cannot reimburse.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p3 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p4 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p5 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p6 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p7 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p8 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p9 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p10
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `the Ministry's second stage` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `join the schools and mark them in the Ministry's systems`
    HENCE (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
           MUST  `check each teacher's conditions and decide on joining`
           HENCE (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
                  MUST  `set the Ofek Hadash grade`
                  HENCE (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
                         MUST  `compute the school's Ofek Hadash profile`)))

@ref akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p11
GIVEN `placement system updated to the Ofek Hadash week` IS A BOOLEAN, `salary interface sent` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Ministry can reimburse` `placement system updated to the Ofek Hadash week` `salary interface sent` IF
    `placement system updated to the Ofek Hadash week` AND `salary interface sent`

§§ `3 תנאי ההצטרפות`

-- akn:art_3__para_3-1/p1 The heading "הגדרות".

@desc A teaching employee of the school, as far as the joining conditions ask.
DECLARE `teacher` HAS
    `has prior recognised teaching seniority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc years of actual teaching recognised before (outside or inside the civil service), other than an internship year or army or national service in teaching (3.1.1)
    `academic`                IS A BOOLEAN @desc holds an academic degree, or a salary grade the teaching-staff division approved as equivalent
    `certified to teach`      IS A BOOLEAN @desc holds a teaching certificate or certification
    `seniority in years`      IS A NUMBER
    `position fraction`       IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position (1 = 100%)
    `health profession`       IS A BOOLEAN @desc occupational therapy, physiotherapy or speech therapy
    `intern`                  IS A BOOLEAN

-- 3.1.1 / 3.1.2: a new teaching employee has no prior recognised years;
-- an existing one is entitled to recognition of years of actual teaching.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-1 akn:art_3__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-2
GIVEN t IS A `teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an existing teacher` t IF
    t's `has prior recognised teaching seniority`

-- 3.2: an existing academic teacher in a school that joined, certified to
-- teach and employed at a third of a position or more, joins.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-2 akn:art_3__para_3-2/p2 akn:art_3__para_3-2/p3 akn:art_3__para_3-2/p4 akn:art_3__para_3-2/p5 akn:art_3__para_3-2/p6 akn:art_3__para_3-2/p7
GIVEN t IS A `teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing academic joins` t IF
        `is an existing teacher` t
    AND t's `academic`
    AND t's `certified to teach`
    AND t's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3

-- Without a certificate: an exceptional request to the exceptions committee
-- on annex B's form, by e-mail. Below 25 years of seniority, no promotion
-- until certified; the work period and part of the studies count for
-- promotion "as in section 12.2.2" (F-2025-26_tashpo_01-d: section 12 has no
-- 12.2.2; the promotion rules for these teachers are 13.2.2).
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-2/p8 akn:art_3__para_3-2/p9 akn:art_3__para_3-2/p10 akn:art_3__para_3-2/p11
GIVEN t IS A `teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an uncertified teacher may not be promoted` t IF
    (NOT t's `certified to teach`) AND t's `seniority in years` LESS THAN 25

`the items of section 12` MEANS LIST "12.1", "12.2"
`the items of section 13.2` MEANS LIST "13.2.1", "13.2.2", "13.2.3"
`3.2 cites a 12.2.2 that section 12 does not have` MEANS
    (NOT elem "12.2.2" `the items of section 12`) AND elem "13.2.2" `the items of section 13.2`
#ASSERT `3.2 cites a 12.2.2 that section 12 does not have`

-- 3.3: an existing non-academic teacher joins in any case at 28 years or
-- more, and not below 28.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-3 akn:art_3__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1 akn:art_3__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-2
GIVEN t IS A `teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing non-academic joins` t IF
        `is an existing teacher` t
    AND NOT t's `academic`
    AND t's `seniority in years` AT LEAST 28

DECLARE `salary table` IS ONE OF
    `first-degree table`
    `second-degree table`
    `senior (בכיר) table`
    `certified (מוסמך) table`
    `uncertified table`

DECLARE `education` IS ONE OF
    `first degree`
    `second degree`
    `doctorate`
    `בכיר`
    `מוסמך`
    `בלתי מוסמך`

-- 3.4.1: a new academic teacher is placed at grade 1 and seniority 1, in
-- the table of the degree; a doctorate in the second-degree table plus 5%
-- of the combined salary. 3.4.2: a new non-academic teacher not entitled to
-- intern's pay (sections 145-148 of the Ofek Hadash agreement) by education.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-4 akn:art_3__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1 akn:art_3__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p2 akn:art_3__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p3 akn:art_3__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p4 akn:art_3__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p5 akn:art_3__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-2
GIVEN e IS AN `education`
GIVETH A `salary table`
DECIDE `the table a new teacher is placed in` e IS
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `first degree` THEN `first-degree table`
    WHEN `second degree` THEN `second-degree table`
    WHEN `doctorate` THEN `second-degree table`
    WHEN `בכיר` THEN `senior (בכיר) table`
    WHEN `מוסמך` THEN `certified (מוסמך) table`
    WHEN `בלתי מוסמך` THEN `uncertified table`

`a new academic teacher's grade` MEANS 1
`a new academic teacher's seniority` MEANS 1

@ref akn:art_3__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p6
GIVEN e IS AN `education`, `combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `doctorate supplement` e `combined salary` IS
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `doctorate` THEN `combined salary` TIMES 0.05
    OTHERWISE 0

-- 3.5: interns. In a school that joined, interns are employed only on
-- reform terms; the internship year counts only at a third of a position
-- or more (3.5.1); it lasts two years at most, by which the intern must
-- complete a degree and a certificate, or leave reform employment (3.5.2);
-- it does not count for salary seniority or the minimum period for
-- promotion, and counts for tenure, the jubilee grant and recuperation
-- (3.5.3).
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-5 akn:art_3__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-1
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship year is recognised` `position fraction` IF
    `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3

@ref akn:art_3__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-2
GIVEN `years of internship` IS A NUMBER, `completed a degree and a certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the intern may stay on reform terms` `years of internship` `completed a degree and a certificate` IF
    `years of internship` AT MOST 2 OR `completed a degree and a certificate`

DECLARE `purpose of seniority` IS ONE OF
    `salary seniority`
    `minimum period for promotion`
    `tenure`
    `jubilee grant seniority`
    `recuperation seniority`

@ref akn:art_3__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-3
GIVEN p IS A `purpose of seniority`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship counts for` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `salary seniority` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `minimum period for promotion` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- akn:art_3__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-4 Points to details of intern evaluation; no rule.
-- akn:art_3__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-5 Points to the dimension map for intern evaluation; no rule.

-- 3.6: a substitute employed in weekly hours (not single hours) is
-- employed on the terms of the teacher replaced.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-6 akn:art_3__para_3-6/p2
GIVEN `the replaced teacher is in the reform` IS A BOOLEAN, `employed in weekly hours` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the substitute is on reform terms` `the replaced teacher is in the reform` `employed in weekly hours` IF
    `employed in weekly hours` AND `the replaced teacher is in the reform`

@export Whether an existing teaching employee of a recognised unofficial special-education school joins Ofek Hadash under circular תשפ"ו/1 section 3
GIVEN t IS A `teacher` @desc the teacher's education, certification, seniority and position
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `joins Ofek Hadash` t IF
    `an existing academic joins` t OR `an existing non-academic joins` t

§§ `4 מבנה שבוע העבודה למורים ברפורמה`

-- 4.1: a full-time teacher works five days a week, also in schools that
-- work six.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-1
`working days a week at a full position` MEANS 5

DECLARE `work week kind` IS ONE OF
    `primary special-education week`
    `secondary special-education week`

DECLARE `school kind` IS ONE OF
    @desc grades 1-6, 1-8 or 1-9
    `primary special-education school`
    @desc several stages in one school, not a primary school of 4.2
    `multi-stage special-education school`
    `secondary special-education school`

-- 4.2: in a primary special-education school (1-6, 1-8, 1-9), every
-- teacher — those kept on the junior-high base of 24 hours included — has
-- the primary week. 4.3: in a multi-stage school, grades 1-6 have the
-- primary week, grades 7-12 the junior-high week of 4.6.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-2 akn:art_4__para_4-2/p2 akn:art_4__para_4-3 akn:art_4__para_4-3/p2 akn:art_4__para_4-3/p3 akn:art_4__para_4-3/p4
GIVEN s IS A `school kind`, grade IS A NUMBER @desc the grade the teacher teaches (1-12)
GIVETH A `work week kind`
DECIDE `the work week` s grade IS
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `primary special-education school` THEN `primary special-education week`
    WHEN `multi-stage special-education school` THEN
        IF grade AT MOST 6 THEN `primary special-education week` ELSE `secondary special-education week`
    WHEN `secondary special-education school` THEN `secondary special-education week`

@desc A full-time work week: its total and how it divides.
DECLARE `work week` HAS
    `week total hours`       IS A NUMBER
    `frontal hours`          IS A NUMBER
    `individual hours`       IS A NUMBER
    `stay hours`             IS A NUMBER
    `meeting hours at most`  IS A NUMBER

-- 4.4: the primary week: 36 hours — 26 frontal, 5 individual (groups of
-- up to 3, content set by the principal), 5 stay hours (meetings up to 2;
-- the rest on the listed tasks). 4.6: the secondary week: 36 — 23, 4, 9
-- (meetings up to 4).
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-4 akn:art_4__para_4-4__subpara_4-4-1 akn:art_4__para_4-4__subpara_4-4-2 akn:art_4__para_4-4__subpara_4-4-3 akn:art_4__para_4-4__subpara_4-4-4 akn:art_4__para_4-4__subpara_4-4-4__cls_1 akn:art_4__para_4-4__subpara_4-4-4__cls_2 akn:art_4__para_4-6 akn:art_4__para_4-6__subpara_4-6-1 akn:art_4__para_4-6__subpara_4-6-2 akn:art_4__para_4-6__subpara_4-6-3 akn:art_4__para_4-6__subpara_4-6-4 akn:art_4__para_4-6__subpara_4-6-4__cls_1 akn:art_4__para_4-6__subpara_4-6-4__cls_2
GIVEN k IS A `work week kind`
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `the teacher's week` k IS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `primary special-education week` THEN `work week` 36 26 5 5 2
    WHEN `secondary special-education week` THEN `work week` 36 23 4 9 4

-- 4.5 / 4.7: health-profession teachers and arts therapists have the
-- teacher's week with 3 individual and 7 stay hours (primary), or 2 and 11
-- (secondary); two stay hours may serve for moving between institutions.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-5 akn:art_4__para_4-5/p2 akn:art_4__para_4-7 akn:art_4__para_4-7/p2
GIVEN k IS A `work week kind`
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `the therapist's week` k IS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `primary special-education week` THEN `work week` 36 26 3 7 2
    WHEN `secondary special-education week` THEN `work week` 36 23 2 11 4

`stay hours a therapist may use for moving between institutions` MEANS 2

-- akn:art_4__para_4-4__subpara_4-4-4__cls_2/p9 Points to the detailed table of the primary week; no rule.
-- akn:art_4__para_4-4__subpara_4-4-4__cls_2/p10 The table's address; no rule.
-- akn:art_4__para_4-4__subpara_4-4-4__cls_2/p11 The address, continued; no rule.
-- akn:art_4__para_4-5/p3 Points to the detailed table of the therapists' primary week; no rule.
-- akn:art_4__para_4-5/p4 The table's address; no rule.
-- akn:art_4__para_4-5/p5 The address, continued; no rule.
-- akn:art_4__para_4-6__subpara_4-6-4__cls_2/p10 Points to the detailed table of the secondary week; no rule.
-- akn:art_4__para_4-6__subpara_4-6-4__cls_2/p11 The table's address; no rule.
-- akn:art_4__para_4-6__subpara_4-6-4__cls_2/p12 The address, continued; no rule.
-- akn:art_4__para_4-7/p3 Points to the detailed table of the therapists' secondary week; no rule.
-- akn:art_4__para_4-7/p4 The table's address; no rule.
-- akn:art_4__para_4-7/p5 The address, continued; no rule.

GIVEN w IS A `work week`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the week adds up` w IF
    w's `frontal hours` PLUS w's `individual hours` PLUS w's `stay hours` EQUALS w's `week total hours`

#ASSERT all `the week adds up` (LIST `the teacher's week` `primary special-education week`, `the teacher's week` `secondary special-education week`,
                                    `the therapist's week` `primary special-education week`, `the therapist's week` `secondary special-education week`)

§§ `5 העסקה בחלקיות משרה ברפורמה`

-- 5.1: at least a third of a position. 5.2: a new (non-intern) teacher at
-- least 70%, and from תשפ"ה (1.9.2024) at least 80%; an intern or an
-- existing teacher at least a third, so as to earn a year of seniority.
-- 5.3: a health-profession teacher may be employed below a third.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-1 akn:art_5__para_5-2 akn:art_5__para_5-2/p2 akn:art_5__para_5-3
GIVEN t IS A `teacher`, `school year opening in` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year the school year opens in (2025 for תשפ"ו)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the minimum position` t `school year opening in` IS
    IF t's `health profession` THEN 0
    ELSE IF `is an existing teacher` t OR t's `intern`
         THEN 1 DIVIDED BY 3
         ELSE IF `school year opening in` AT LEAST 2024 THEN 0.8 ELSE 0.7

-- 5.4: a part-time position is cut from each kind of hour in proportion.
-- Below a third, for a health-profession teacher, or a teacher of a needed
-- subject by special approval, at three frontal hours or fewer ("single
-- frontal hours"): frontal hours only, and the position is their ratio to
-- the position base.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-4
GIVEN w IS A `work week`, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `the part-time week` w `position fraction` IS
    `work week` (w's `week total hours` TIMES `position fraction`)
                (w's `frontal hours` TIMES `position fraction`)
                (w's `individual hours` TIMES `position fraction`)
                (w's `stay hours` TIMES `position fraction`)
                (w's `meeting hours at most` TIMES `position fraction`)

@ref akn:art_5__para_5-4/p2
GIVEN `single frontal hours` IS A NUMBER, `position base` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position of single frontal hours` `single frontal hours` `position base` IS
    `single frontal hours` DIVIDED BY `position base`

-- 5.5: no more than two schools, and the cumulative position no more than
-- 100% in all employments — not for health-profession teachers or a subject
-- the division allows in more schools.
-- F-2025-26_tashpo_01-e: 6.3 lets a teacher in two institutions be placed
-- up to 106% without approval, and 6.4 above it with approval.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-5
GIVEN t IS A `teacher`, `schools` IS A NUMBER, `total position` IS A NUMBER, `subject allowed in more schools` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `5.5 permits the employment` t `schools` `total position` `subject allowed in more schools` IF
    t's `health profession` OR `subject allowed in more schools`
    OR (`schools` AT MOST 2 AND `total position` AT MOST 1)

-- 5.6: below a third of a position, the period does not count towards the
-- minimum period for promotion.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-6
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the period counts towards the minimum period for promotion` `position fraction` IF
    `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3

§§ `6 העסקה מעל 100% משרה ברפורמה`

-- 6.1: as a rule up to 100%; beyond it in exceptional cases for teachers
-- (not principals or first deputies), frontal hours only, at most 8.5 hours
-- a day and 42 a week. 6.2: in one institution the principal may approve up
-- to 42 weekly hours, with no request. 6.3: in two institutions, up to 106%
-- with no request; 6.4: beyond 106%, a request in the entitlements system.
DECLARE `approval needed` IS ONE OF
    `none beyond the rule`
    `the principal's approval`
    `no request needed`
    `a request in the entitlements system`
    `not permitted`

@ref akn:art_6__para_6-1 akn:art_6__para_6-1/p2 akn:art_6__para_6-1/p3 akn:art_6__para_6-1/p4 akn:art_6__para_6-2 akn:art_6__para_6-3 akn:art_6__para_6-4
GIVEN `principal or first deputy` IS A BOOLEAN, `institutions` IS A NUMBER, `total position` IS A NUMBER, `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER, `daily hours at most` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `approval needed`
DECIDE `what employment beyond 100% needs` `principal or first deputy` `institutions` `total position` `weekly hours` `daily hours at most` IS
    IF `total position` AT MOST 1 THEN `none beyond the rule`
    ELSE IF `principal or first deputy` OR `weekly hours` GREATER THAN 42 OR `daily hours at most` GREATER THAN 8.5
         THEN `not permitted`
         ELSE IF `institutions` EQUALS 1
              THEN `the principal's approval`
              ELSE IF `total position` AT MOST 1.06
                   THEN `no request needed`
                   ELSE `a request in the entitlements system`

`a teacher in two schools at 104%` MEANS
    `teacher` WITH
        `has prior recognised teaching seniority` IS TRUE
        `academic`                IS TRUE
        `certified to teach`      IS TRUE
        `seniority in years`      IS 10
        `position fraction`       IS 1.04
        `health profession`       IS FALSE
        `intern`                  IS FALSE

`5.5 forbids what 6.3 allows without a request` MEANS
        (NOT `5.5 permits the employment` `a teacher in two schools at 104%` 2 1.04 FALSE)
    AND `what employment beyond 100% needs` FALSE 2 1.04 37 8 EQUALS `no request needed`
#ASSERT `5.5 forbids what 6.3 allows without a request`

-- akn:art_6__para_6-4/p2 A link to the procedure for employment above 100% in recognised unofficial education for תשפ"ו; not in the corpus.

§§ `7 משרת הורה`

-- 7.1: a mother's position per the takanon: employed in her whole position
-- at 79% or more. 7.2: one frontal and one stay hour less. 7.3: after
-- maternity leave, at 90% or more, for four months: one hour a day off the
-- stay hours (five a week), and 7.2 does not apply then. 7.4: "79% to 90%":
-- the mother's reduction of 7.2. 7.5: never both at once.
@ref akn:art_7__para_7-1 akn:art_7__para_7-1/p2
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to a mother's position` `position fraction` IF
    `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.79

DECLARE `mother's reduction` IS ONE OF
    `no reduction`
    @desc 7.2: one frontal hour and one stay hour a week
    `a mother's hours`
    @desc 7.3: one stay hour a day, five a week, for four months after maternity leave
    `nursing hours`

@ref akn:art_7__para_7-2 akn:art_7__para_7-2/p2
GIVEN r IS A `mother's reduction`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `weekly hours reduced` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `no reduction` THEN 0
    WHEN `a mother's hours` THEN 2
    WHEN `nursing hours` THEN 5

@ref akn:art_7__para_7-3
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `within four months of maternity leave` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `7.3 gives nursing hours` `position fraction` `within four months of maternity leave` IF
    `within four months of maternity leave` AND `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.9

@ref akn:art_7__para_7-4
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `within four months of maternity leave` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `7.4 gives a mother's hours` `position fraction` `within four months of maternity leave` IF
    `within four months of maternity leave` AND `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.79 AND `position fraction` AT MOST 0.9

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_01-f: at exactly 90%, 7.3 and 7.4 both apply, and 7.5
-- forbids both. The reading adopted: 90% is 7.3's ("90% ומעלה").
`at 90% after maternity leave both 7.3 and 7.4 apply` MEANS
    `7.3 gives nursing hours` 0.9 TRUE AND `7.4 gives a mother's hours` 0.9 TRUE
#ASSERT `at 90% after maternity leave both 7.3 and 7.4 apply`

@ref akn:art_7__para_7-5
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `within four months of maternity leave` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `mother's reduction`
DECIDE `the mother's reduction` `position fraction` `within four months of maternity leave` IS
    IF `7.3 gives nursing hours` `position fraction` `within four months of maternity leave`
    THEN `nursing hours`
    ELSE IF `entitled to a mother's position` `position fraction`
         THEN `a mother's hours`
         ELSE `no reduction`

§§ `8 מורים הזכאים לשעות גיל`

-- 8.1: the age of entitlement is as before the reform. 8.2: existing and
-- new teachers aged "50 – 55": two frontal hours less (pro rata part-time),
-- base 34. 8.3: existing teachers aged 55 and over: three frontal hours and
-- one individual hour less, base 32. 8.4: new teachers 55 and over: two
-- frontal hours only, base 34, and nothing beyond what they got at 50.
-- akn:art_8__para_8-1 The age of entitlement is unchanged from before the reform; no number is stated, so the ages below are the circular's own.

@desc An age-hours band as a clause prints it.
DECLARE `age band` HAS
    `band from age`            IS A NUMBER
    `band to age`              IS A NUMBER  @desc 999 stands for "ומעלה"
    `for existing teachers`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `for new teachers`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `frontal hours off`        IS A NUMBER
    `individual hours off`     IS A NUMBER
    `position base after`      IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_8__para_8-2 akn:art_8__para_8-3 akn:art_8__para_8-4
`the age bands` MEANS
    LIST `age band` 50 55  TRUE  TRUE  2 0 34,
         `age band` 55 999 TRUE  FALSE 3 1 32,
         `age band` 55 999 FALSE TRUE  2 0 34

-- akn:art_8__para_8-4/p2 The age-hours week is in the work-week tables linked above; no rule.

GIVEN age IS A NUMBER, existing IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `age band`
DECIDE `the bands for` age existing IS
    filter (GIVEN b YIELD age AT LEAST b's `band from age` AND age AT MOST b's `band to age`
                          AND ((existing AND b's `for existing teachers`) OR ((NOT existing) AND b's `for new teachers`)))
           `the age bands`

-- The bases follow from the reduction: 36 less the hours taken off.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN b YIELD b's `position base after` EQUALS 36 MINUS b's `frontal hours off` MINUS b's `individual hours off`) `the age bands`

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_01-g: an existing teacher aged exactly 55 is in 8.2's
-- "50 – 55" and in 8.3's "55 ומעלה": two hours off, or four.
`an existing teacher aged 55 has two age bands` MEANS
    count (`the bands for` 55 TRUE) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `an existing teacher aged 55 has two age bands`

-- The reading adopted: 8.2's band ends below 55, as 8.3 opens at 55.
@export The weekly frontal and individual hours a teacher of a special-education school in Ofek Hadash has off for age under circular תשפ"ו/1 section 8, at a full position
GIVEN age IS A NUMBER @desc the teacher's age in years
      existing IS A BOOLEAN @desc an existing teacher (3.1.2) rather than a new one (3.1.1)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `age hours off` age existing IS
    IF age AT LEAST 55 AND existing THEN 4
    ELSE IF age AT LEAST 50 THEN 2
         ELSE 0

§§ `9 מבנה שבוע העבודה למנהלים וסגנים ראשונים`

-- 9.1: a principal and a first deputy work 100% (no less, no more), five
-- days. 9.2 / 9.7: a 40-hour week.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-1 akn:art_9__para_9-2 akn:art_9__para_9-7
`the principal's position` MEANS 1
`the principal's week in hours` MEANS 40

-- 9.3–9.6: the school's complexity level (eight levels, by the school
-- management index — classes, kinds of disability, stages; at least 3 in
-- special education) sets the teaching hours and the pay. It is computed in
-- early May of the previous year from the Ministry's data; a new or growing
-- school is computed in December, at the minimum until then, and updated
-- back to the year's start.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-3 akn:art_9__para_9-4
GIVEN `index level` IS A NUMBER @desc the level the school management index gives (1-8)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the complexity level` `index level` IS
    max 3 (min 8 `index level`)

@ref akn:art_9__para_9-5 akn:art_9__para_9-6
GIVEN `new or growing` IS A BOOLEAN, `computed in December` IS A BOOLEAN, `index level` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the complexity level in force` `new or growing` `computed in December` `index level` IS
    IF `new or growing` AND NOT `computed in December`
    THEN 3
    ELSE `the complexity level` `index level`

@desc A complexity level and the frontal hours it gives.
DECLARE `hours row` HAS
    `row level`         IS A NUMBER
    `row frontal hours` IS A NUMBER

-- The principal's table (9.2: 6-9 hours).
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-6/p2 akn:art_9__para_9-6/p3 akn:art_9__para_9-6/p4 akn:art_9__para_9-6/p5 akn:art_9__para_9-6/p6 akn:art_9__para_9-6/p7 akn:art_9__para_9-6/p8 akn:art_9__para_9-6/p9 akn:art_9__para_9-6/p10 akn:art_9__para_9-6/p11 akn:art_9__para_9-6/p12
`the principal's hours table` MEANS
    LIST `hours row` 3 9, `hours row` 4 8, `hours row` 5 8, `hours row` 6 7, `hours row` 7 7, `hours row` 8 6

-- akn:art_9__para_9-6/p13 Points to details of how complexity is computed; no rule.
-- akn:art_9__para_9-6/p14 The address; no rule.

-- 9.7.1–9.7.3: the first deputy's tables: primary 18-21, secondary 9-11,
-- multi-stage 13-15.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-7__subpara_9-7-1 akn:art_9__para_9-7__subpara_9-7-1/t1
`the primary first deputy's table` MEANS
    LIST `hours row` 3 21, `hours row` 4 21, `hours row` 5 20, `hours row` 6 20, `hours row` 7 19, `hours row` 8 18

@ref akn:art_9__para_9-7__subpara_9-7-2 akn:art_9__para_9-7__subpara_9-7-2/t1
`the secondary first deputy's table` MEANS
    LIST `hours row` 3 11, `hours row` 4 11, `hours row` 5 11, `hours row` 6 11, `hours row` 7 9, `hours row` 8 9

@ref akn:art_9__para_9-7__subpara_9-7-3 akn:art_9__para_9-7__subpara_9-7-3/t1
`the multi-stage first deputy's table` MEANS
    LIST `hours row` 3 15, `hours row` 4 15, `hours row` 5 14, `hours row` 6 14, `hours row` 7 13, `hours row` 8 13

GIVEN low IS A NUMBER, high IS A NUMBER, table IS A LIST OF `hours row`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the table stays in its stated range` low high table IF
        all (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row frontal hours` AT LEAST low AND r's `row frontal hours` AT MOST high) table
    AND map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row level`) table EQUALS range 3 8

#ASSERT `the table stays in its stated range` 6 9 `the principal's hours table`
#ASSERT `the table stays in its stated range` 18 21 `the primary first deputy's table`
#ASSERT `the table stays in its stated range` 9 11 `the secondary first deputy's table`
#ASSERT `the table stays in its stated range` 13 15 `the multi-stage first deputy's table`

GIVEN level IS A NUMBER, table IS A LIST OF `hours row`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the frontal hours at level` level table IS
    sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row frontal hours`) (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row level` EQUALS level) table))

-- 9.8: a second deputy and onward has the teacher's week, the individual
-- hours spent on the deputy's work. 9.9: a principal or first deputy
-- entitled to a mother's position: two weekly hours off the non-frontal
-- hours. 9.10: at 50 and over, two hours off the same; position and pay
-- unchanged in both.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-8
GIVEN k IS A `work week kind`
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `the second deputy's week` k IS `the teacher's week` k

@ref akn:art_9__para_9-9 akn:art_9__para_9-10
GIVEN `entitled to a mother's position` IS A BOOLEAN, age IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a principal's non-frontal hours off` `entitled to a mother's position` age IS
    (IF `entitled to a mother's position` THEN 2 ELSE 0)
    PLUS (IF age AT LEAST 50 THEN 2 ELSE 0)

-- 9.11: an existing non-academic principal with 1-27 years of salary
-- seniority must complete an academic degree within four years of the
-- school's joining to stay a principal, on the non-academic principals'
-- terms until then. 9.12: at 28 years or more, the non-academic terms.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-11 akn:art_9__para_9-12
GIVEN `salary seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the non-academic principal must complete a degree within four years` `salary seniority` IF
    `salary seniority` AT LEAST 1 AND `salary seniority` AT MOST 27

-- 9.13: the principals' and first deputies' pay is global (agreement of
-- 19.10.2022, section 31.1): it rewards all their managerial work whenever
-- done.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-13 akn:art_9__para_9-13/p2
`a principal's pay is global` MEANS TRUE

§§ `10 שעות פעילות בית ספרית`

-- 10.1–10.2: on top of the position and salary, 125% of the hour value for
-- school activities, up to 40 hours a year. 10.3: including a pre-opening
-- meeting (up to 3 hours). 10.4: the activities, divided by the principal.
-- 10.5: on the teacher's day off, 125%. 10.6: instead of a stay hour that
-- day, 125% and not the stay hour's 100%. 10.7: instead of a stay hour
-- that the teacher works another day, 125% plus the 100%.
DECLARE `when the activity is done` IS ONE OF
    `on the teacher's day off`
    `instead of a stay hour that day`
    `instead of a stay hour worked another day`
    `outside the working hours`

@ref akn:art_10__para_10-1 akn:art_10__para_10-2 akn:art_10__para_10-3 akn:art_10__para_10-4 akn:art_10__para_10-5 akn:art_10__para_10-6 akn:art_10__para_10-7
GIVEN w IS A `when the activity is done`, `hour value` IS A NUMBER, hours IS A NUMBER, `hours already allotted this year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pay for school activity` w `hour value` hours `hours already allotted this year` IS
    LET counted MEANS max 0 (min hours (40 MINUS `hours already allotted this year`))
    IN  CONSIDER w
        WHEN `instead of a stay hour that day` THEN counted TIMES `hour value` TIMES (1.25 MINUS 1)
        OTHERWISE counted TIMES `hour value` TIMES 1.25

`a pre-opening meeting in hours at most` MEANS 3

§§ `11 יציאה מאופק חדש`

-- 11.1: as a rule every teacher meeting the conditions joins. 11.2: in
-- exceptional cases a request to leave may be considered for health (the
-- teacher's or a first-degree relative's, with current medical proof) or
-- humanitarian reasons (a change for the worse after joining). 11.3–11.4:
-- on annex C's form, to the teaching-staff conditions officer by e-mail.
DECLARE `reason to leave` IS ONE OF
    `health with current medical proof`
    `humanitarian change for the worse after joining`
    `another reason`

@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1 akn:art_11__para_11-2 akn:art_11__para_11-2/p2 akn:art_11__para_11-2/p3 akn:art_11__para_11-2/p4 akn:art_11__para_11-3 akn:art_11__para_11-4
GIVEN r IS A `reason to leave`, `filed on the annex C form` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a request to leave may be considered` r `filed on the annex C form` IF
    `filed on the annex C form` AND NOT (r EQUALS `another reason`)

§§ `12 ותק בהוראה`

-- 12.1: the seniority for moving up the salary table is seniority in
-- teaching as the takanon defines it, without the internship and without
-- compulsory army service, but with army or national service in teaching.
-- 12.2: an existing teacher keeps every year recognised before joining.
DECLARE `period of service` IS ONE OF
    `teaching`
    `internship`
    `compulsory army service`
    `army or national service in teaching`
    `recognised for salary before joining`

@ref akn:art_12__para_12-1 akn:art_12__para_12-2
GIVEN p IS A `period of service`, existing IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `counts as recognised seniority` p existing IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `teaching` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `internship` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `compulsory army service` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `army or national service in teaching` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `recognised for salary before joining` THEN existing

§§ `13 קידום בדרגות`

-- 13.1: promotion needs the minimum period (פז"נ), professional-development
-- hours (שפ"מ) and an evaluation by the Ministry's rules.
@ref akn:art_13__para_13-1 akn:art_13__para_13-1/p2 akn:art_13__para_13-1/p3 akn:art_13__para_13-1/p4
GIVEN `months in the grade` IS A NUMBER, `development hours` IS A NUMBER, `evaluated` IS A BOOLEAN, step IS A `promotion step`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be promoted` `months in the grade` `development hours` `evaluated` step IF
        `months in the grade` AT LEAST step's `months required`
    AND `development hours` AT LEAST step's `development hours required`
    AND `evaluated`

-- akn:art_13__para_13-1/p5 Points to details of the evaluation; no rule.
-- akn:art_13__para_13-1/p6 The address; no rule.
-- akn:art_13__para_13-1/p7 Points to the dimension map; no rule.
-- akn:art_13__para_13-1/p8 The address; no rule.
-- akn:art_13__para_13-1/p9 The address, continued; no rule.
-- akn:art_13__para_13-2/p1 The heading of the teachers' promotion rules.

@desc A promotion step: from a grade to the next, the months and the development hours it needs.
DECLARE `promotion step` HAS
    `from grade`                  IS A NUMBER
    `months required`             IS A NUMBER
    `development hours required`  IS A NUMBER

-- 13.2.1: academics certified to teach.
@ref akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-1 akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-1/p2 akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-1/p3 akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-1/t1
`the certified academics' steps` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` 1 30 120, `promotion step` 2 30 120, `promotion step` 3 36 180,
         `promotion step` 4 36 180, `promotion step` 5 36 180, `promotion step` 6 48 210,
         `promotion step` 7 48 210, `promotion step` 8 48 210

-- 13.2.2: academics not certified. Veterans of up to 25 years who joined
-- by exception are not promoted until certified; then the period and
-- development hours count from their joining, for one promotion only, and
-- up to 60 hours of the studies count. From 25 years they need no
-- certification. New teachers who joined by exception start counting at
-- certification.
@ref akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-2 akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-2/p2 akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-2/p3 akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-2/p4 akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-2/p5 akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-2/p6 akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-2/p7
GIVEN t IS A `teacher`, `certified since joining` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `study hours counted as development hours` t `certified since joining` IS
    IF `is an existing teacher` t AND t's `seniority in years` LESS THAN 25 AND `certified since joining`
    THEN 60
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-2/p6
GIVEN t IS A `teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `promoted as a certified academic without certification` t IF
    t's `academic` AND `is an existing teacher` t AND t's `seniority in years` AT LEAST 25

-- 13.2.3: certified non-academics. From 1.9.2023 sections 51, 59, 60 and
-- 61 of the Ofek Hadash agreement are cancelled, except for those who
-- undertook before 30.6.2023 to complete a degree within four years. From
-- 28 years they need not; their steps are 48 months and 480 hours.
@ref akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-3 akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-3/p2 akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-3/p3 akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-3/p4 akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-3/p5 akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-3/t1
`the certified non-academics' steps` MEANS
    map (GIVEN g YIELD `promotion step` g 48 480) (range 1 8)

@ref akn:art_13__para_13-2__subpara_13-2-3/p2
GIVEN `undertook before 30.6.2023 to complete a degree` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `sections 51 and 59-61 still apply` `undertook before 30.6.2023 to complete a degree` IF
    `undertook before 30.6.2023 to complete a degree`

-- 13.3: principals and deputies, grades א' to ד' (numbered 1-3 here):
-- certified academics 36 months and 210 hours; certified non-academics of
-- 28 years or more 48 and 480.
@ref akn:art_13__para_13-3 akn:art_13__para_13-3__subpara_13-3-1 akn:art_13__para_13-3__subpara_13-3-1/p2 akn:art_13__para_13-3__subpara_13-3-1/p3 akn:art_13__para_13-3__subpara_13-3-1/t1
`the academic managers' steps` MEANS
    map (GIVEN g YIELD `promotion step` g 36 210) (range 1 3)

@ref akn:art_13__para_13-3__subpara_13-3-2 akn:art_13__para_13-3__subpara_13-3-2/p2 akn:art_13__para_13-3__subpara_13-3-2/p3 akn:art_13__para_13-3__subpara_13-3-2/t1
`the non-academic managers' steps` MEANS
    map (GIVEN g YIELD `promotion step` g 48 480) (range 1 3)

-- Every table runs from grade to grade with no grade skipped.
#ASSERT map (GIVEN s YIELD s's `from grade`) `the certified academics' steps` EQUALS range 1 8

§§ `14 יועצים חינוכיים`

-- 14.1: a counsellor has an academic teacher's week; frontal hours split
-- between teaching and counselling as the principal sets; individual hours
-- are counselling; stay hours as a teacher's, also for counselling. At
-- least 1/6 of the position in frontal teaching in primary and junior-high
-- schools (6 of 36), and at least 4 frontal hours for any position.
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-1 akn:art_14__para_14-1/p2 akn:art_14__para_14-1/p3 akn:art_14__para_14-1/p4 akn:art_14__para_14-1/p5 akn:art_14__para_14-1/p6 akn:art_14__para_14-1/p7
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a counsellor's minimum frontal teaching` `position fraction` IS
    max (36 TIMES `position fraction` DIVIDED BY 6) 4

-- 14.2: new counsellors are on the new combined tables for academic teachers.
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-2
`a new counsellor's table` MEANS `first-degree table`

-- 14.3: at least 7 counselling hours: 12% with a temporary licence, 18%
-- with a permanent one.
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-3 akn:art_14__para_14-3/p2 akn:art_14__para_14-3/p3
GIVEN `counselling hours` IS A NUMBER, `permanent licence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the counselling allowance rate` `counselling hours` `permanent licence` IS
    IF `counselling hours` LESS THAN 7 THEN 0
    ELSE IF `permanent licence` THEN 0.18 ELSE 0.12

§§ `15 קביעת הדרגה באופק חדש`

-- 15.2–15.5: the grade rests on employment, education and salary data; the
-- conversion uses March's salary in the year before joining (seniority,
-- grade, training, roles, conversion factor), at 100% by the roles; the
-- grade may be a half grade.
@ref akn:art_15__para_15-2 akn:art_15__para_15-3 akn:art_15__para_15-4 akn:art_15__para_15-5
GIVEN `grade set` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a grade the conversion may set` `grade set` IF
    TRUNC (`grade set` TIMES 2) 0 EQUALS `grade set` TIMES 2

-- akn:art_15__para_15-6 Points to the booklet on setting grades and to annex D; the booklet is not in the corpus.
-- akn:art_15__para_15-6/p2 The booklet's address; no rule.
-- akn:art_15__para_15-6/p3 Points to the salary tables; not in the corpus.
-- akn:art_15__para_15-6/p4 The address; no rule.
-- akn:art_15__para_15-6/p5 Points to the 2016 shekel-supplement circular; no rule.
-- akn:art_15__para_15-6/p6 The address; no rule.
-- akn:art_15__para_15-6/p7 Points to the Ofek 2022 supplement circular; no rule.
-- akn:art_15__para_15-6/p8 The address; no rule.

-- 15.7: the role allowances (as a share of the combined salary), at most
-- two per teacher.
DECLARE `role` IS ONE OF
    `second deputy principal`
    `class educator`
    `first-grade class educator`
    `subject coordinator in primary`
    `subject coordinator in junior high`
    `road-safety coordinator`
    `security coordinator`
    `social education in primary`
    `social education in junior high`
    `grade coordinator up to 4 classes`
    `grade coordinator above 4 classes`
    `laboratory coordinator`
    `measurement and evaluation coordinator`
    `trips coordinator`
    `inclusion coordinator`
    `pedagogical coordinator`
    `mentor` HAS `interns mentored` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_15__para_15-7 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p2 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p3 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p4 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p5 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p6 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p7 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p8 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p9 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p10 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p11 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p12 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p13 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p14 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p15
GIVEN r IS A `role`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the role allowance rate` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `second deputy principal` THEN 0.2
    WHEN `class educator` THEN 0.1
    WHEN `first-grade class educator` THEN 0.115
    WHEN `subject coordinator in primary` THEN 0.06
    WHEN `subject coordinator in junior high` THEN 0.08
    WHEN `road-safety coordinator` THEN 0.06
    WHEN `security coordinator` THEN 0.06
    WHEN `social education in primary` THEN 0.08
    WHEN `social education in junior high` THEN 0.1
    WHEN `grade coordinator up to 4 classes` THEN 0.07
    WHEN `grade coordinator above 4 classes` THEN 0.06
    WHEN `laboratory coordinator` THEN 0.03
    WHEN `measurement and evaluation coordinator` THEN 0.06
    WHEN `trips coordinator` THEN 0.06
    WHEN `inclusion coordinator` THEN 0.06
    WHEN `pedagogical coordinator` THEN 0.06
    WHEN `mentor` n THEN 0.024 TIMES min n 3

@ref akn:art_15__para_15-7/p16
`the most role allowances a teacher may have` MEANS 2

GIVEN roles IS A LIST OF `role`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `role allowances paid` roles IS
    sum (map `the role allowance rate` (take `the most role allowances a teacher may have` roles))

-- The special-education allowance (agreement of 19.10.2022, from
-- 1.9.2023, on section 39א(3) of the Ofek Hadash agreement). Certified in
-- special education: 9% becomes 10%, 14% becomes 15%, and 17% in a class
-- of the autism or severe-mental-disorder kind. Not certified: (א) 5.5%;
-- (ב) 8.5% in special education.
DECLARE `special-education case` IS ONE OF
    `certified, formerly 9%`
    `certified, formerly 14%`
    `certified, in an autism or severe-mental-disorder class`
    `not certified`
    `not certified, in special education`

@ref akn:art_15__para_15-7/p17 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p18 akn:art_15__para_15-7/p19 akn:art_15__para_15-7__subpara_a akn:art_15__para_15-7__subpara_b akn:art_15__para_15-7__subpara_c akn:art_15__para_15-7__subpara_c/p2 akn:art_15__para_15-7__subpara_c__cls_a akn:art_15__para_15-7__subpara_c__cls_b
GIVEN c IS A `special-education case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special-education allowance rate` c IS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `certified, formerly 9%` THEN 0.1
    WHEN `certified, formerly 14%` THEN 0.15
    WHEN `certified, in an autism or severe-mental-disorder class` THEN 0.17
    WHEN `not certified` THEN 0.055
    WHEN `not certified, in special education` THEN 0.085

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_01-h: every teacher this circular covers teaches in a
-- special-education school, so an uncertified one is both "not certified"
-- (5.5%) and "not certified, in special education" (8.5%). The reading
-- adopted: (ב), the specific one, governs teachers in special education.
GIVEN `teaches in special education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the rates for an uncertified teacher` `teaches in special education` IS
    IF `teaches in special education`
    THEN LIST `the special-education allowance rate` `not certified`, `the special-education allowance rate` `not certified, in special education`
    ELSE LIST `the special-education allowance rate` `not certified`

`an uncertified special-education teacher has two rates` MEANS
    count (`the rates for an uncertified teacher` TRUE) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `an uncertified special-education teacher has two rates`

-- 15.8: minimum shekel amounts — the higher of the percentage and: a class
-- educator 1,000; a grade coordinator 1,100; junior-division management
-- 1,100; a deputy 20% or 1,100 (printed "1.100").
DECLARE `minimum role` IS ONE OF
    `class education`
    `first-grade class education`
    `grade coordination up to 4 classes`
    `grade coordination above 4 classes`
    `junior-division management up to 4 classes`
    `junior-division management above 4 classes`
    `deputy`

@ref akn:art_15__para_15-8 akn:art_15__para_15-8__subpara_15-8-1 akn:art_15__para_15-8__subpara_15-8-2 akn:art_15__para_15-8__subpara_15-8-3 akn:art_15__para_15-8__subpara_15-8-4
GIVEN r IS A `minimum role`, `combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the role allowance with its minimum` r `combined salary` IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `class education` THEN max (0.1 TIMES `combined salary`) 1000
    WHEN `first-grade class education` THEN max (0.115 TIMES `combined salary`) 1000
    WHEN `grade coordination up to 4 classes` THEN max (0.07 TIMES `combined salary`) 1100
    WHEN `grade coordination above 4 classes` THEN max (0.06 TIMES `combined salary`) 1100
    WHEN `junior-division management up to 4 classes` THEN max (0.07 TIMES `combined salary`) 1100
    WHEN `junior-division management above 4 classes` THEN max (0.06 TIMES `combined salary`) 1100
    WHEN `deputy` THEN max (0.2 TIMES `combined salary`) 1100

§§ `16 גמול ליווי טיולים`

-- 16.1: under the agreement of 8.9.98, but only for hours beyond the
-- working hours of section 4.
@ref akn:art_16__para_16-1
GIVEN `hours of the trip` IS A NUMBER, `working hours that day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `trip hours that may be rewarded` `hours of the trip` `working hours that day` IS
    max 0 (`hours of the trip` MINUS `working hours that day`)

-- 16.2's table: units by the hour the activity ends (א), a detached
-- activity 16:00-24:00 (ב), an activity with an overnight stay (ג).
@desc A row of 16.2א: an activity ending from a time to a time earns units.
DECLARE `ending band` HAS
    `ends from`   IS A NUMBER  @desc hour of the day, 24-hour clock
    `ends by`     IS A NUMBER
    `band units`  IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_16__para_16-2 akn:art_16__para_16-2/p2 akn:art_16__para_16-2__subpara_a akn:art_16__para_16-2__subpara_a/p2 akn:art_16__para_16-2__subpara_a/p3 akn:art_16__para_16-2__subpara_a/p4 akn:art_16__para_16-2__subpara_a/p5 akn:art_16__para_16-2__subpara_a/p6
`the ending table` MEANS
    LIST `ending band` 0  15 0,
         `ending band` 15 16 0.5,
         `ending band` 16 18 1.5,
         `ending band` 18 21 3,
         `ending band` 21 24 4.5

GIVEN `ending hour` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the units the table gives for` `ending hour` IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `band units`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD `ending hour` AT LEAST b's `ends from` AND `ending hour` AT MOST b's `ends by`) `the ending table`)

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_01-i: the rows share their ends — "עד 15:00" and
-- "בין 15:00 ל-16:00", and so on — so an activity ending on the hour is in
-- two rows.
`an activity ending at 16:00 is in two rows` MEANS
    `the units the table gives for` 16 EQUALS LIST 0.5, 1.5
#ASSERT `an activity ending at 16:00 is in two rows`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN h YIELD count (`the units the table gives for` h) EQUALS 2) (LIST 15, 16, 18, 21)

DECLARE `trip kind` IS ONE OF
    `ending at an hour` HAS `ending at` IS A NUMBER
    @desc 16.2ב: 16:00 to 24:00
    `detached activity`
    @desc 16.2ג
    `activity with an overnight stay`

-- The reading adopted: an hour that ends one row and opens the next
-- belongs to the row it ends.
@ref akn:art_16__para_16-2__subpara_b akn:art_16__para_16-2__subpara_b/p2 akn:art_16__para_16-2__subpara_c
GIVEN k IS A `trip kind`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `trip units` k IS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `ending at an hour` h THEN
        BRANCH IF h AT MOST 15 THEN 0
               IF h AT MOST 16 THEN 0.5
               IF h AT MOST 18 THEN 1.5
               IF h AT MOST 21 THEN 3
               OTHERWISE 4.5
    WHEN `detached activity` THEN 3
    WHEN `activity with an overnight stay` THEN 6.5

-- 16.3: a unit is 0.7% of the monthly combined salary for a full position
-- (not by the position held).
@ref akn:art_16__para_16-3
GIVEN k IS A `trip kind`, `combined salary at a full position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `trip allowance` k `combined salary at a full position` IS
    `trip units` k TIMES 0.007 TIMES `combined salary at a full position`

-- 16.4: on the teacher's day off or a day of fewer than 7 hours, paid at the
-- reform's substitute-hour value: 7 hours less the hours placed that day,
-- or the hours of the activity, whichever is lower.
@ref akn:art_16__para_16-4 akn:art_16__para_16-4/p2 akn:art_16__para_16-4/p3 akn:art_16__para_16-4/p4 akn:art_16__para_16-4/p5 akn:art_16__para_16-4/p6 akn:art_16__para_16-4/p7 akn:art_16__para_16-4/p8 akn:art_16__para_16-4/p9
GIVEN `hours placed that day` IS A NUMBER, `activity hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `substitute hours for a trip` `hours placed that day` `activity hours` IS
    min (max 0 (7 MINUS `hours placed that day`)) `activity hours`

§§ `17 מקדמות שכר באופק חדש עד לקביעת הדרגה`

-- 17.1: until the grade is set, the owner pays an advance ("מקדמת אופק
-- חדש") to the teachers the Ministry joined, on top of their current pay,
-- computed on the listed components of it, for the part of the employment
-- in the joined school, from the joining date. Once the grade is set, the
-- salary is recomputed back to the joining date, and what was paid —
-- advance included — is set off.
@ref akn:art_17__para_17-1 akn:art_17__para_17-1/p2
GIVEN `rate` IS A NUMBER, `current components` IS A NUMBER @desc the current combined salary, the '87, '94, 2001, 2008 and 2011 supplements, the split, training and double-degree allowances
      `share in the joined school` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Ofek Hadash advance` `rate` `current components` `share in the joined school` IS
    `rate` TIMES `current components` TIMES `share in the joined school`

@ref akn:art_17__para_17-1/p3
GIVEN `salary by Ofek Hadash from joining` IS A NUMBER, `paid from joining, advance included` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the retroactive difference` `salary by Ofek Hadash from joining` `paid from joining, advance included` IS
    `salary by Ofek Hadash from joining` MINUS `paid from joining, advance included`

DECLARE `advance group` IS ONE OF
    `teacher or intern in primary or grades 1-6`
    `teacher or intern in secondary or grades 7 and up`
    `academic first deputy`
    `academic principal`
    `non-academic first deputy`
    `non-academic principal`

-- 17.2: 14% (primary, grades 1-6), 20% (secondary, grades 7 up), 17%
-- academic first deputies, 12% academic principals.
@ref akn:art_17__para_17-2 akn:art_17__para_17-2/p2 akn:art_17__para_17-2/p3 akn:art_17__para_17-2/p4 akn:art_17__para_17-2/p5 akn:art_17__para_17-2/p6 akn:art_17__para_17-2/p7 akn:art_17__para_17-2/p8 akn:art_17__para_17-2/p9 akn:art_17__para_17-2/p10
GIVEN g IS AN `advance group`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the advance rate` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `teacher or intern in primary or grades 1-6` THEN JUST 0.14
    WHEN `teacher or intern in secondary or grades 7 and up` THEN JUST 0.2
    WHEN `academic first deputy` THEN JUST 0.17
    WHEN `academic principal` THEN JUST 0.12
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_01-j: 9.11-9.12 employ non-academic principals on reform
-- terms, and 17.2 gives no advance rate for them or for non-academic first
-- deputies.
`17.2 gives no rate for non-academic principals or first deputies` MEANS
    isNothing (`the advance rate` `non-academic principal`) AND isNothing (`the advance rate` `non-academic first deputy`)
#ASSERT `17.2 gives no rate for non-academic principals or first deputies`

-- akn:art_17__para_17-2/p11 Instructions on reimbursing the advance are to follow in a separate circular; no rule.

GIVEN g IS AN `advance group`, `current components` IS A NUMBER, `share in the joined school` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `the advance paid until the grade is set` g `current components` `share in the joined school` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the Ofek Hadash advance` a
          PROVIDED a AT LEAST `the Ofek Hadash advance` (fromMaybe 0 (`the advance rate` g)) `current components` `share in the joined school`

§§ `18 שעון הנוכחות`

-- 18.1–18.3: an attendance clock is installed and teachers report their
-- hours by it, counted from clocking in and not before 7:45; by hand until
-- it is installed. 18.4: the owner pays and deducts by the clock's data,
-- after checking justified absences.
@ref akn:art_18__para_18-1 akn:art_18__para_18-3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `the attendance clock` IS
    (PARTY `the employer`
     MUST  `install an attendance clock`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teaching employee`
     MUST  `report working hours by the clock`)

@ref akn:art_18__para_18-2
GIVEN `clock-in hour` IS A NUMBER @desc hours after midnight (7.75 = 7:45)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `working time counts from` `clock-in hour` IS
    max `clock-in hour` 7.75

@ref akn:art_18__para_18-4
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `pay and deduct by the clock` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay and deduct by the clock`

-- akn:art_18__para_18-4/p2 Further information at the addresses of annex E; no rule.
-- akn:art_18__para_18-4/p3 The circular's purpose: to gather the rules of the Ofek Hadash agreements.

-- Where the circular and the collective agreements conflict, for the
-- employee or against, the agreements prevail.
@ref akn:art_18__para_18-4/p4
GIVEN `the circular's answer` IS A NUMBER, `the agreements' answer` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the governing answer` `the circular's answer` `the agreements' answer` IS
    `the agreements' answer`

-- akn:conclusions The signatures and copies; no rule.

§§ `נספח א' כתב התחייבות`

-- The undertaking: the owner's authorised signatory, citing regulation
-- 3(6), undertakes to apply to the teaching staff of its special-education
-- schools every provision of the Ofek Hadash agreement of 25.12.2008 as
-- updated (the work week, the pay, the pedagogical rules), knowing that
-- failure may bring sanctions up to the revocation of the licence.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 akn:att_1__hc_1/p5 akn:att_1__hc_1/p6
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `the undertaking` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `apply all the Ofek Hadash provisions`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
           MAY   `impose sanctions up to revoking the licence`)

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_01-a: the annex's title has the undertaking start in
-- תשפ"ו, its body binds the owner "משנת הלימודים תשפ"ה ואילך". School years
-- by the calendar year they open in.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p1
`the undertaking's start by its title` MEANS 2025

`the undertaking's start by its body` MEANS 2024

`the undertaking's title and body name different first years` MEANS
    NOT (`the undertaking's start by its title` EQUALS `the undertaking's start by its body`)
#ASSERT `the undertaking's title and body name different first years`

