-- Placed at grade א+ for complexity 3: 20,086.68.
@ref akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p4
`the principal's new combined salary` MEANS 20086.68

-- The personal supplement for the part of the position above 100% (up to
-- 140%): T is the full salary by the position (March before joining; for
-- a principal on leave then, the March before the leave); B = T × (100 +
-- Y) / 100; C = B less the new table salary, turned into a percentage of
-- the combined salary.
@ref akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p5 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p6 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p7 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p8 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p9 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p10 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p11 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p12 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p13 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p14 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p15
GIVEN T IS A NUMBER, Y IS A NUMBER, `new table salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the personal supplement` T Y `new table salary` IS
    `to the agora` (T TIMES (1 PLUS Y)) MINUS `new table salary`

GIVEN T IS A NUMBER, Y IS A NUMBER, `new table salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the personal supplement as a percentage` T Y `new table salary` IS
    `the personal supplement` T Y `new table salary` DIVIDED BY `new table salary`

-- The example: T = 20,735.13; B = 23,845.40; C = 3,758.72; 18.712%.
@ref akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p16 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p17 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_1 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_2 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_3 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_4
`the principal's T` MEANS `the principal's components by the position` PLUS `the principal's management allowance`

#ASSERT `the principal's T` EQUALS 20735.13
#ASSERT `the personal supplement` `the principal's T` `a principal's conversion factor` `the principal's new combined salary` EQUALS 3758.72
#ASSERT TRUNC (`the personal supplement as a percentage` `the principal's T` `a principal's conversion factor` `the principal's new combined salary` TIMES 100000) 0 EQUALS 18712

§§ `נספח ה' כתובות לפניות`

-- akn:att_5__hc_1 Annex E, the addresses for questions (districts, support, the teachers' portal, the national centre, the Ofek contractor, promotion, undertakings, employment approvals, the profile); no rule.

-- Examples (teachers, positions and salaries are placeholders).
`an existing certified academic at half a position` MEANS
    `teacher` WITH
        `has prior recognised teaching seniority` IS TRUE
        `academic`                IS TRUE
        `certified to teach`      IS TRUE
        `seniority in years`      IS 12
        `position fraction`       IS 0.5
        `health profession`       IS FALSE
        `intern`                  IS FALSE
#ASSERT `joins Ofek Hadash` `an existing certified academic at half a position`

`an existing non-academic with 20 years` MEANS
    `teacher` WITH
        `has prior recognised teaching seniority` IS TRUE
        `academic`                IS FALSE
        `certified to teach`      IS TRUE
        `seniority in years`      IS 20
        `position fraction`       IS 1
        `health profession`       IS FALSE
        `intern`                  IS FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `joins Ofek Hadash` `an existing non-academic with 20 years`

