#ASSERT `age hours off` 55 TRUE EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `age hours off` 52 TRUE EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the mother's reduction` 0.9 TRUE EQUALS `nursing hours`
#ASSERT `the mother's reduction` 0.85 TRUE EQUALS `a mother's hours`
#ASSERT `role allowances paid` (LIST `class educator`, `trips coordinator`, `laboratory coordinator`) EQUALS 0.16
#ASSERT `the role allowance with its minimum` `class education` 8000 EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `trip units` (`ending at an hour` 17) EQUALS 1.5
#ASSERT `trip allowance` `activity with an overnight stay` 10000 EQUALS 455
#ASSERT `substitute hours for a trip` 2 9 EQUALS 5
#ASSERT `pay for school activity` `instead of a stay hour worked another day` 100 4 38 EQUALS 250
#ASSERT `a counsellor's minimum frontal teaching` 0.5 EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `the teacher's conversion factor` 0.3 FALSE FALSE EQUALS 0.24
#ASSERT `the month for the salary to convert` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the joining month`

#TRACE `the undertaking by 31.8.2025` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `send the signed undertaking` AT 40
