    PARTY `the employer` DOES `send the undertaking with proof of operating and paying by Ofek Hadash` AT 90
#TRACE `the owner's second stage` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `send the salary interface to the Ministry's contractor` AT 80
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `set the Ofek Hadash grade` AT 120
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay by the grade set and deduct the advances` AT 150
